      "Selected adapter: foundationdb; native ordered range batches plus touched overlay merge.",
      "Native bytes are client key/value payload counters, including physical namespace and V8 receipt/value encoding; they exclude network framing, disk/WAL amplification and replication. Definite rollback/conflict preserves attempted SDK write bytes but commits none.",
